---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Iron Altar" description="Iron Altar - strength-training application case study.">
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">Case study</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Iron Altar</h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        A strength-training application focused on clear programming and tracking. This page reflects the current in-progress state.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
        <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-4 py-1 transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400" href="https://github.com/steventclarke/iron-altar">GitHub</a>
        <a class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-4 py-1 transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400" href="https://ironaltar.stevenclarke.dev">Demo</a>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Problem</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Keep training programs and sessions structured without adding friction to daily workouts.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Pragmatic data modeling with a focus on clarity, fast inputs, and a layout that works well on mobile.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Status</h2>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">In progress. Architecture and screenshots are tracked in the repository.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
